  description="Proof Complexity Preprint v0.8: complete polynomial-time resolution of Krajíček's CF -> ≈-Chain problem (arXiv:2606.13367v2, p. 11) across DAG path-copying, aligned SLPs, and non-aligned Context-SLPs via hash-consed Jeż recompression up to depth 3.46×10¹⁸ (1.56 s), plus formal syntactic-vs-semantic dichotomy in 5 standalone Lean 4.36.0 suites (0 sorryAx)."
