      <a class="button button-outline" href="https://github.com/M4QSZ/certified-arith-preproc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Repository + reproduce.sh ↗</a>
      <a class="button button-outline" href="https://github.com/M4QSZ/certified-arith-preproc/blob/main/papers/PAPER_2_KRAJICEK_CF_APPROX_COMPLETE_DICHOTOMY.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Markdown source ↗</a>
